{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>無綫年度盛事《萬千星輝賀台慶2026》昨日隆重舉行，當家花旦張曦雯以一身極具話題性透視長裙亮相紅地毯成為全場焦點。面對傳媒追問性感戰衣有否事先讓緋聞男友吳卓羲過目時，她毫不避忌作正面回應。她當晚在台上台下連串舉動意外揭示二人最新關係發展。</p>\n<h2>張曦雯穿越南設計師透視長裙亮相</h2>\n<p>昨日紅地毯環節星光熠熠，張曦雯一改過往冷酷性感路線，換上一套由越南設計師打造米白色薄紗喱士吊帶長裙出場。這套長裙胸前位置縫上3個黑色小蝴蝶結，配搭隨性長麻花低辮以及閃爍鑽石飾物，整體造型散發出陣陣法式浪漫氛圍。由於當晚氣溫驟降，她在薄紗裙內貼滿暖包保暖，並透露這套戰衣去到台慶前一晚才作最終定案。</p>\n<h2>張曦雯霸氣回應吳卓羲過目戰衣一事</h2>\n<p>面對現場傳媒問及如此性感打扮有否先讓緋聞男友吳卓羲過目時，張曦雯全程笑容滿面並作出強硬護航。她直接向記者表示：「使乜問呀？現代女性有自主權！你哋早過佢過目，佢睇電視咪得囉，佢都冇得揀㗎啦，只可以話靚！」雖然男方未有出席今次盛會，但她在台慶夜依然表現落力，先與前輩羅嘉良同台跳唱，隨後亦跟羅子溢參與互動遊戲。</p>\n<h2>參演《璀璨之城》與吳卓羲傳出緋聞 大方承認男方正展開追求</h2>\n<p>張曦雯去年剛結束一段長達8年感情，最近因拍攝劇集《璀璨之城》而與同劇演員吳卓羲擦出愛火花。早前她更大方承認男方正展開追求，令外界高度關注兩人感情發展。在昨日節目尾聲大合照環節中，她獲安排站在頭排核心位置。</p>\n<h2>網民激讚張曦雯新造型散發滿滿幸福感</h2>\n<p>隨著多張幕後花絮照片及短片在社交平台曝光，大批網民紛紛湧入留言區表達意見。有觀眾認為張曦雯現時狀態極佳，並留下「拍拖真係會令女人變靚」以及「面相柔和咗好多，成個人發緊光！」等正面評價。部分人觀看花絮片段後，亦表示從她身上感受到滿滿幸福感，並留言指出「愛情滋潤果然係最好嘅保養品！」<br/>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516754573410780_8279584086b00153a68585.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kelllycheung_1795150766_4034339218062098971_2121370.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516754573410780_8279584086b00153a68585.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@kelllycheung）</figcaption></figure>\n</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_17227230856add80685d9af.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"吳卓羲 張曦雯 吳卓羲近日與張曦雯傳出緋聞（圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/11_17227230856add80685d9af.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>吳卓羲近日與張曦雯傳出緋聞（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516754730274205_4595498886b00153bc3912.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kelllycheung_1795150766_4034339239092465769_2121370.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516754730274205_4595498886b00153bc3912.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@kelllycheung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516754885892123_2990824606b00153d53b25.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kelllycheung_1795150766_4034339226534783121_2121370.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516754885892123_2990824606b00153d53b25.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@kelllycheung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516755064822316_6963100006b00153f1885e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kelllycheung_1795150766_4034339223954441379_2121370.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516755064822316_6963100006b00153f1885e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@kelllycheung）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516755200583077_6028671026b001540578bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"kelllycheung_1795150766_4034339221551742965_2121370.jpg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179516755200583077_6028671026b001540578bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：IG@kelllycheung）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T10:03:54.324594+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1099,"images":6,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T09:39:14+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-20T10:57:23.089727+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T09:57:21.157970+00:00","content_hash":"fd42ece1973413a92f807f9b3b2e7f12ba0e4a83b5fb7c8fa013b7da0135b9e8","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}